[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0090","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0220","title":"FreeBSD ja-elvis/ko-helvis 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.5.1/4.2 系统中的 ja-elvis 和 ko-helvis 端口软件包存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 elvrec 程序发送超长数据触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.5.1 及 4.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0220"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:54Z","remediation":"建议立即移除或升级受影响系统上的 ja-elvis/ko-helvis 端口软件包：执行 `pkg_delete ja-elvis` 或 `pkg_delete ko-helvis` 删除；若需继续使用 elvis 编辑器，应通过 ports tree 更新至最新版本（`cd /usr/ports/editors/elvis && make install clean`），或从厂商获取打了补丁的版本。作为临时缓解措施，可通过 `chmod 4555` 移除 elvrec 的 setuid 位以阻止提权利用（`chmod 755 /usr/local/bin/elvrec`），并限制非信任用户本地登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2001-02/0082.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/287","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0220.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0220","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0220.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0220.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w9xw-2x44-pv33/GHSA-w9xw-2x44-pv33.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83022/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0220.json","https://github.com/a