证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露，影响运行 Way-Board 2.0 的所有 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0214"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:53Z","remediation":"Way-Board 2.0 CGI 程序已停止维护，无官方安全补丁。永久修复方案：将该 CGI 程序下线，迁移至现代受支持的论坛系统（如 phpBB、Discourse 等）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置规则，过滤 db 请求参数中的 null 字节（%00）与路径遍历字符（../），可添加 RewriteCond %{QUERY_STRING} db=.*%00 [NC] 并返回 403 状态码拒绝请求；同时建议在 CGI 脚本入口处增加输入验证，移除 db 参数中的 \\x00 字符以防止任意文件读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0212.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2370","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20629","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0214.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0214","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0214.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0214.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w4g7-gwxv-m92f/GHSA-w4g7-gwxv-m92f.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/wayboard.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0214.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2370/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulne