读写（chmod 700 /var/mfaslmf/nolicense），并将 mfaslmf 目录权限收紧为 750（chmod 750 /var/mfaslmf），同时以 root 身份删除目录内所有可被普通用户修改的脚本。建议升级至 Micro Focus Cobol 后续版本，以彻底修复该权限配置缺陷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0205.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2359","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20621","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0208","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1ce9765ce7bccd5f940cdb53e9ce6846944cee75/2001/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8aab22d02785f79271894073fc1a1d558c4aae6b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0208.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0208.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0208.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0081","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0206","title":"Soft Lite ServerWorx 3.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Soft Lite ServerWorx 3.00 存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP GET 请求的路径名中插入 ..（两个点）或 ...（三个点）等特殊字符突破目录访问限制，读取服务器上任意文件。该漏洞影响 Soft Lite ServerWorx 3.00 版本，攻击者无需身份验证即可发起利用，成功利用可导致敏感信息泄露，如配置文件、密码文件等。攻击条件为目标系统运行存在漏洞的 ServerWorx 版本且允许外部 HTTP 访问，攻击者只需构造包含目录遍历序列的恶意 URL 即可实现任意文件读取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0206"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"建议迁移至 Apache、Nginx 或 IIS 等现代 Web 服务器。若必须继续使用，请在 Web 服务器层面配置目录访问限制，并在 WAF 中添加规则拦截包含 ../ 或 ... 的请求路径，防止目录遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0137.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2346","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20616","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0206","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f71e6da69aa54c2303f943ea4b05f52ce2f911ff/2001/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/709d7a1077875b40fcef6c8e7b7d04e5c3506666/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0206.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0206.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0206.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0059","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0151","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 WebDAV 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 的 WebDAV 组件在处理畸形的 HTTP 请求时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标 IIS 服务器发送一系列特制的 WebDAV 请求，导致服务器 CPU 占用率飙升或进程崩溃，无法正常响应合法用户请求。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 平台上运行的 IIS 5.0 版本，攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可触发。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS01-016 修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0151"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 于 2001 年 3 月发布的安全补丁 MS01-016（下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=400E3C59-62D6-4BCC-AB39-D7AE8DDF902E），该补丁修复了 WebDAV 处理畸形请求时的 CPU 耗尽漏洞。如无法安装补丁，可将系统升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 2（该修复已包含在 SP2 中）。临时缓解措施：按照 KB Q241520 禁用 WebDAV 服务（删除注册表中 WebDAV 的 ISAPI 筛选器映射），但会损失 Web Folders 和 Office 2000 发布等远程协作功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-016","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6205","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A90","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20664","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0151.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0151.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0151","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0151.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0151.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0151.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0151.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0151.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81a148a05078ecaf8ff30dafcb6a9851540b3434/2001/CVE-2001-0151.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0059.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0059.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0058","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0150","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Telnet 客户端任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 及更早版本的 Telnet 客户端存在参数注入漏洞。当用户访问恶意网站时，攻击者可通过 URL 中指定的命令行参数控制 IE 调用的 Telnet 会话行为，结合 Services for Unix (SFU) 2.0 提供的 Telnet 客户端会创建会话记录文件的特点，实现任意文件覆写或任意命令执行。攻击条件要求用户使用 SFU 2.0 的 Telnet 客户端并点击恶意链接，影响范围包括 IE 5.0.1/5.5/6.0 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0150"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46Z","remediation":"升级 Internet Explorer 至 6.0 及以上版本，或卸载 Services for Unix (SFU) 2.0 中的 Telnet 客户端。如无法升级，在 IE 安全设置中将「Internet 区域」的「对标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件执行脚本」设为禁用，并删除注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\TelnetClient 下的关联配置项以阻止命令行参数传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7816","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2463","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6230","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20680","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0150.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0150.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0150","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0150.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0150.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71536d4487506e17956a8631415b45ef3865b35d/2001/CVE-2001-0150.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0150.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0150.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0150.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0150.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0058.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0058.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0057","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0149","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Windows Script Host 文件泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Script Host 5.1及5.5版本中存在文件泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过Internet Explorer 5.5及更早版本，利用GetObject Javascript函数与htmlfile ActiveX对象，读取目标系统上的任意文件。攻击者只需诱使用户访问恶意网页即可触发该漏洞，无需任何身份认证。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，影响Windows 98/Me/NT/2000等操作系统。微软已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0149"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","u