],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0056","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0148","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 ActiveX 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Media Player 7.0 中的 WMP ActiveX 控件存在跨域验证绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 Internet Explorer 中构造特制的 javascript URL 链接，诱使用户点击后绕过框架域验证机制，在用户浏览器上下文中执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Player 7.0 及关联的 IE 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害等级高。目前已有公开 PoC 代码，建议用户升级至更高版本或禁用相关 ActiveX 控件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0148"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-06-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Windows Media Player 7.0，升级到 Windows Media Player 9 或更高版本。如无法升级，在 Internet Explorer 中设置 killbit 禁用 WMP ActiveX 控件（CLSID: 22D6F312-B0F6-11D0-94AB-0080C74C7E95），方法：在注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Internet Explorer\\ActiveX Compatibility 下新建对应 CLSID 项，将 Compatibility Flags DWORD 值设为 0x400。同时将 Internet 区域安全级别设为高，禁用 ActiveX 脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0000.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6227","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20528","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0148.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0148.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0148","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0148.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0148.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/b